  "title": "Sea Bass Cuban Style",
  "description": "A fresh, flavorful Cuban-style fish recipe. Sea bass cooked simply in tomato, onion, caper, and white wine sauce. Great served with rice pilaf.",
  "authors": [
    "Kiki Hahn"
  ],
